{"id":"650029","name":"凉拌皮冻","author":"牙医的烦恼","authorId":"10717209","desc":"","cover":"images/650029/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪皮","amount":"250克"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"1块"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1段"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"2根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪皮放碱，放米醋抓洗干净，焯水，剔除肥肉，洗干净。","img":"images/650029/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切丝。","img":"images/650029/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放葱姜料酒，煮开，撇清浮沫，煮1个小时。","img":"images/650029/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮至粘稠，冷却。","img":"images/650029/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"皮冻切片，黄瓜拍碎，香菜切段。","img":"images/650029/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"小碗里放蒜末，熟芝麻，辣椒粉，辣椒圈，淋热油，倒入捞汁，蚝油，辣椒油。","img":"images/650029/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"所有的食材和料汁一起拌匀。","img":"images/650029/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/650029/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}